{"hr":{"plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);","messages":{"Downloading Samsung's certificate tooling (44 MB, once)...":{"*":["Preuzimanje Samsungovih alata za certifikate (44 MB, jednom)..."]},"Samsung certificate tooling ready":{"*":["Samsung alat za certifikate spreman"]},"Requesting the author certificate...":{"*":["Zatraživanje certifikata autora..."]},"Requesting the distributor certificate...":{"*":["Zatraživanje certifikata distributera..."]},"TV id: {duid}":{"*":["TV id: {duid}"]},"Opening the Samsung sign-in in your browser. Log in there; this window will continue by itself.":{"*":["Otvaranje Samsung prijave u vašem pregledniku. Prijavite se tamo; ovaj prozor će se nastaviti sam."]},"Authorization was cancelled":{"*":["Autorizacija je otkazana"]},"Could not get administrator access":{"*":["Nije moguće dobiti administratorski pristup"]},"Could not start Docker":{"*":["Docker se nije uspio pokrenuti"]},"Docker did not start in time":{"*":["Docker se nije pokrenuo na vrijeme"]},"pkexec was not found. Start Docker manually.":{"*":["pkexec nije pronađen. Pokrenite Docker ručno."]},"The TV answered, but Developer Mode is not active yet.\n\nOn the TV, check that:\n  • Developer Mode is On\n  • the Host PC IP is {ip}\n  • the TV was unplugged from the wall after that\n\nSwitching it off with the remote is not enough: that only puts it on standby. The installation port opens on a real restart.":{"*":["Televizor je odgovorio, ali Način rada za razvojne programere još nije aktivan.\n\nNa televizoru provjerite sljedeće:\n  • Način rada za razvojne programere je uključen\n  • IP adresa računala (Host PC IP) je {ip}\n  • televizor je nakon toga isključen iz zidne utičnice\n\nIsključivanje daljinskim upravljačem nije dovoljno: time se televizor samo prebacuje u stanje pripravnosti. Instalacijski priključak otvara se tek nakon stvarnog ponovnog pokretanja."]},"your computer's IP":{"*":["IP adresa vašeg računala"]},"Go Back":{"*":["Idi nazad"]},"Main Menu":{"*":["Glavni izbornik"]},"Preferences":{"*":["Postavke"]},"About":{"*":["O programu"]},"JellyBeam Team":{"*":["JellyBeam Tim"]},"JellyBeam Contributors":{"*":["JellyBeam Suradnici"]},"OK":{"*":["U redu"]},"Confirm":{"*":["Potvrdi"]},"Cancel":{"*":["Otkaži"]},"Setup Device":{"*":["Postavljanje uređaja"]},"Connect":{"*":["Poveži"]},"Install":{"*":["Instaliraj"]},"Complete":{"*":["Dovršeno"]},"Step {number} of {total}":{"*":["Korak {number} od {total}"]},"Bring Jellyfin to your big screen":{"*":["Donesite Jellyfin na svoj veliki ekran"]},"Developer Certificates":{"*":["Certifikati programera"]},"Certificates are required to install apps on Samsung TVs":{"*":["Certifikati su potrebni za instalaciju aplikacija na Samsung TV-ima"]},"Certificate Mode":{"*":["Način certifikata"]},"Use Built-in Certificates":{"*":["Koristi ugrađene certifikate"]},"Recommended - No Tizen Studio required":{"*":["Preporučeno - Nije potreban Tizen Studio"]},"How it works":{"*":["Kako to funkcionira"]},"The Docker container includes pre-configured certificates. You can install Jellyfin immediately without any setup.":{"*":["Docker kontejner uključuje unaprijed konfigurirane certifikate. Možete odmah instalirati Jellyfin bez ikakve postavke."]},"Custom Certificates (Advanced)":{"*":["Prilagođeni certifikati (Napredno)"]},"Only needed if you want to use your own certificates":{"*":["Samo je potrebno ako želite koristiti vlastite certifikate"]},"Author Certificate":{"*":["Certifikat autora"]},"Select author.p12 file":{"*":["Odaberite datoteku author.p12"]},"Browse":{"*":["Pretraži"]},"Distributor Certificate":{"*":["Certifikat distributera"]},"Select distributor.p12 file":{"*":["Odaberite distributor.p12 datoteku"]},"Certificate Password":{"*":["Lozinka za certifikat"]},"Password for the author P12 certificate":{"*":["Lozinka za P12 certifikat autora"]},"Create with your Samsung account":{"*":["Izradi pomoću Samsung računa"]},"Signs in through your browser and fills in the fields above":{"*":["Prijavljuje se putem preglednika i popunjava gornja polja"]},"Create":{"*":["Izradi"]},"Need help creating certificates?":{"*":["Trebate pomoć pri izradi certifikata?"]},"View tutorial on Samsung Developer website":{"*":["Pogledajte vodič na web stranici Samsung Developer."]},"View Guide":{"*":["Pogledaj vodič"]},"Continue to Installation":{"*":["Nastavi na instalaciju"]},"Proceed to install Jellyfin on your TV":{"*":["Nastavite s instalacijom Jellyfina na vašem TV-u"]},"Continue":{"*":["Nastavi"]},"Ready to install with built-in certificates":{"*":["Spreman za instalaciju s ugrađenim certifikatima"]},"Select {cert_type} certificate":{"*":["Odaberite {cert_type} certifikat"]},"P12 Certificate Files":{"*":["P12 certifikacijske datoteke"]},"Change":{"*":["Promjena"]},"Connect to your TV first":{"*":["Najprije povežite svoj TV"]},"Working...":{"*":["Izrađuje se..."]},"Could not create the certificate":{"*":["Certifikat nije moguće izraditi"]},"Certificate created for this TV":{"*":["Certifikat je izrađen za ovaj TV"]},"Ready to install with custom certificates":{"*":["Spreman za instalaciju s prilagođenim certifikatima"]},"author certificate":{"*":["certifikat autora"]},"distributor certificate":{"*":["certifikat distributera"]},"password":{"*":["lozinka"]},"Missing: {items}":{"*":["Nedostaje: {items}"]},"Installation":{"*":["Instalacija"]},"Certificate Error":{"*":["Pogreška certifikata"]},"Device Setup":{"*":["Postavke uređaja"]},"Connect to your Samsung Tizen TV or projector":{"*":["Povežite se s vašim Samsung Tizen TV-om ili projektorom"]},"Setup Instructions":{"*":["Upute za postavljanje"]},"Enable Developer Mode on TV":{"*":["Omogući način rada za programere na TV-u"]},"Click to view step-by-step instructions":{"*":["Kliknite za prikaz korak-po-korak uputa"]},"1. Open Apps":{"*":["1. Otvori aplikacije"]},"On the TV, go to the 'Apps' section":{"*":["Na TV-u idite u odjeljak 'Aplikacije'"]},"2. Go to App Settings":{"*":["2. Idite na Postavke aplikacije"]},"Scroll to the end and 