orite Jellyfin aplikaciju na svom TV-u"]},"Done":{"*":["Završeno"]},"Log copied":{"*":["Zapisnik kopiran"]},"Tizen version unavailable":{"*":["Verzija Tizena nedostupna"]},"This TV needs a Samsung certificate":{"*":["Ovaj TV zahtijeva Samsung certifikat"]},"Tizen {version} only accepts packages signed with a certificate issued by Samsung for your account, with this TV registered. Create one in Tizen Studio's Certificate Manager, then add it under Certificates.":{"*":["Tizen {version} prihvaća samo pakete potpisane certifikatom koji je Samsung izdao za vaš račun, uz registriran ovaj TV. Izradite ga u Certificate Manageru unutar Tizen Studija, a zatim ga dodajte pod Certifikati."]},"No device selected - please go back":{"*":["Nema odabranog uređaja - molimo vratite se nazad"]},"No TV configured. Please go back and select a device.":{"*":["Nema konfigurirane TV. Molimo vas da se vratite i odaberete uređaj."]},"Starting Installation":{"*":["Pokretanje instalacije"]},"Downloading container...":{"*":["Preuzimanje kontejnera..."]},"Pulling Docker image...":{"*":["Preuzimanje Docker slike..."]},"Container ready!":{"*":["Kontejner spreman!"]},"Installing to TV...":{"*":["Instaliranje na TV..."]},"Connecting and installing...":{"*":["Povezivanje i instalacija..."]},"This may take a few minutes...":{"*":["Ovo može potrajati nekoliko minuta..."]},"Installing...":{"*":["Instaliranje..."]},"Downloading app...":{"*":["Preuzimanje aplikacije..."]},"Transferring...":{"*":["Prebacivanje..."]},"Connecting to TV...":{"*":["Povezivanje s TV-om..."]},"Finishing...":{"*":["Završavanje..."]},"Extracting layers...":{"*":["Izdvajanje slojeva..."]},"Download complete":{"*":["Preuzimanje završeno"]},"Error":{"*":["Greška"]},"Jellyfin is now on your TV":{"*":["Jellyfin je sada na vašem TV-u"]},"Reinstall":{"*":["Ponovno instaliraj"]},"Find Jellyfin in your TV's app list.":{"*":["Pronađite Jellyfin na popisu aplikacija vašeg TV-a."]},"Installation Failed":{"*":["Instalacija nije uspjela"]},"Retr